msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/credentialIssuerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "credentialIssuer is functional"
msgstr "credentialIssuer 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/credentialIssuerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:credentialIssuer is functional: one issuing organization is constitutive of a gmeow:Credential's identity, so a different issuer yields a different credential even for the same subject matter."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:credentialIssuer 是函数性的：唯一的颁发机构构成 gmeow:Credential 身份的组成部分，因此即便针对同一主题，不同的颁发机构也会产生不同的凭证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/skillProficiencyAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "skillProficiencyAgent is functional"
msgstr "skillProficiencyAgent 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/skillProficiencyAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:skillProficiencyAgent is functional: a gmeow:SkillProficiency expresses the proficiency of exactly one agent, whose identity is constitutive of the reified proficiency."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:skillProficiencyAgent 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:SkillProficiency 恰好表达一个主体的技能水平,该主体的身份是这个具化技能水平记录的构成性要素。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/skillProficiencyLevelFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "skillProficiencyLevel is functional"
msgstr "skillProficiencyLevel 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/skillProficiencyLevelFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:skillProficiencyLevel is functional: a gmeow:SkillProficiency records exactly one attained level (a single gmeow:ProficiencyLevel such as dreyfusExpert or assessedCompetent), and a second level would be a separate assessment."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:skillProficiencyLevel 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:SkillProficiency 恰好记录一个已达到的等级(单一的 gmeow:ProficiencyLevel,例如 dreyfusExpert 或 assessedCompetent),第二个等级将构成一次独立的评估。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/skillProficiencyOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "skillProficiencyOf is functional"
msgstr "skillProficiencyOf 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/skillProficiencyOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:skillProficiencyOf is functional: a gmeow:SkillProficiency concerns exactly one skill, constitutive of which proficiency it is."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:skillProficiencyOf 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:SkillProficiency 恰好涉及一项技能,这正是它所记录之技能水平身份的构成性要素。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/skillProficiencyScaleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "skillProficiencyScale is functional"
msgstr "skillProficiencyScale 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/skillProficiencyScaleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:skillProficiencyScale is functional: a gmeow:SkillProficiency's level is measured on exactly one scale (Dreyfus, NIH, assessed, or self-reported), so the same attainment read on another scale is a distinct proficiency record."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:skillProficiencyScale 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:SkillProficiency 的等级恰好按一种量表(Dreyfus、NIH、经评估或自我报告)来衡量,因此同一成就若按另一种量表解读,便构成一条不同的技能水平记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/credentialIssuerFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:credentialIssuer names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:credentialIssuer 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/credentialIssuerFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/credentialIssuerFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:credentialIssuer, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:credentialIssuer, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/credentialIssuerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:credentialIssuerFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:credentialIssuer ."
msgstr "gmeow:credentialIssuerFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:credentialIssuer ."

